---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const pageTitle = "МатАрхива | Училишни Решенија";
const pageDescription = "Комплексни решенија за училишта, аналитика, управување со наставници и стандардизирана математичка настава.";
---

<Layout title={pageTitle}>
	<meta name="description" content={pageDescription} />

	{/* School Hero Section */}
	<div class="relative mb-16 p-12 md:p-20 rounded-[3rem] bg-gradient-to-br from-orange-50 via-amber-50/50 to-yellow-50 dark:from-orange-900/20 dark:via-amber-900/10 dark:to-yellow-900/10 overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border border-orange-200/50 dark:border-orange-800/30">
		<div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-full h-full opacity-20 pointer-events-none">
			<div class="absolute top-[-10%] right-[-10%] w-[50%] h-[50%] bg-orange-600 rounded-full blur-[120px]"></div>
			<div class="absolute bottom-[-10%] left-[-10%] w-[40%] h-[40%] bg-amber-600 rounded-full blur-[100px]"></div>
		</div>

		<div class="relative z-10 max-w-4xl">
			<div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-8">
				<span class="inline-block px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-orange-500/10 text-orange-400 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] border border-orange-500/20 backdrop-blur-md">
					🏫 Училишни Решенија
				</span>
			</div>

			<h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-8 leading-[1.1] tracking-tight">
				Комплетно <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-orange-400 to-amber-400">училишно</span> решение
			</h1>

			<p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-xl mb-10 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl font-medium">
				Аналитика, управување со наставници и стандардизирана математичка настава за цело училиште.
			</p>

			<div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 max-w-2xl">
				<a href="#demo" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-orange-600 hover:bg-orange-700 text-white font-bold py-4 px-8 rounded-xl transition-all">
					<span>Види Демо</span>
					<svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
						<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/>
					</svg>
				</a>
				<a href="#contact" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 text-slate-900 dark:text-white font-bold py-4 px-8 rounded-xl border border-white/20 transition-all">
					<span>Контактирај Нас</span>
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>

	{/* School Solutions */}
	<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto mb-16 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
		<div class="group bg-gradient-to-br from-orange-50 to-amber-50 dark:from-orange-900/20 dark:to-amber-900/10 rounded-3xl p-8 border border-orange-200/50 dark:border-orange-800/30 shadow-lg hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-orange-500/10 hover:-translate-y-2 transition-all duration-300">
			<div class="w-16 h-16 bg-orange-100 dark:bg-orange-900/30 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
				<span class="text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400 text-3xl">📊</span>
			</div>
			<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-orange-900 dark:text-orange-100 mb-3">Училишна Аналитика</h3>
			<p class="text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Детални извештаи за успехот на учениците, наставниците и програмите.</p>
		</div>

		<div class="group bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50 to-yellow-50 dark:from-amber-900/20 dark:to-yellow-900/10 rounded-3xl p-8 border border-amber-200/50 dark:border-amber-800/30 shadow-lg hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-amber-500/10 hover:-translate-y-2 transition-all duration-300">
			<div class="w-16 h-16 bg-amber-100 dark:bg-amber-900/30 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
				<span class="text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 text-3xl">👥</span>
			</div>
			<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-amber-900 dark:text-amber-100 mb-3">Управување со Наставници</h3>
			<p class="text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Алатки за следење на наставната работа и професионален развој.</p>
		</div>

		<div class="group bg-gradient-to-br from-yellow-50 to-orange-50 dark:from-yellow-900/20 dark:to-orange-900/10 rounded-3xl p-8 border border-yellow-200/50 dark:border-yellow-800/30 shadow-lg hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-yellow-500/10 hover:-translate-y-2 transition-all duration-300">
			<div class="w-16 h-16 bg-yellow-100 dark:bg-yellow-900/30 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
				<span class="text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 text-3xl">📚</span>
			</div>
			<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-yellow-900 dark:text-yellow-100 mb-3">Стандардизирана Настава</h3>
			<p class="text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Конзистентни наставни материјали според национални стандарди.</p>
		</div>
	</div>

	{/* School Dashboard Preview */}
	<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto mb-16" id="demo">
		<div class="text-center mb-12">
			<h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-4">Училишна Контролна Табла</h2>
			<p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto">Централно место за управување со сите аспекти на математичката настава.</p>
		</div>

		<div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-[3rem] p-8 border border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-2xl">
			{/* Mock Dashboard Header */}
			<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-8 pb-6 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700">
				<div>
					<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">ОУ "Гоце Делчев" - Сколска Година 2025/26</h3>
					<p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Скопје, Македонија</p>
				</div>
				<div class="flex items-center gap-4">
					<div class="text-right">
						<div class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Вкупно ученици</div>
						<div class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">1,247</div>
					</div>
					<div class="text-right">
						<div class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Наставници</div>
						<div class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">23</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>

			{/* Dashboard Grid */}
			<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 mb-8">
				<div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50 to-indigo-50 dark:from-blue-900/20 dark:to-indigo-900/10 rounded-2xl p-6">
					<div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
						<div class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900/30 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center">
							<span class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 text-xl">📈</span>
						</div>
						<div>
							<h4 class="font-bold text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100">Просечен Успех</h4>
							<p class="text-sm text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400">Математика</p>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="text-3xl font-black text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 mb-2">4.2</div>
					<div class="text-sm text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400">+0.3 од минатата година</div>
				</div>

				<div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-green-50 to-emerald-50 dark:from-green-900/20 dark:to-emerald-900/10 rounded-2xl p-6">
					<div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
						<div class="w-12 h-12 bg-green-100 dark:bg-green-900/30 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center">
							<span class="text-green-600 dark:text-green-400 text-xl">🎯</span>
						</div>
						<div>
							<h4 class="font-bold text-green-900 dark:text-green-100">Завршени Лекции</h4>
							<p class="text-sm text-green-600 dark:text-green-400">Оваа недела</p>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="text-3xl font-black text-green-900 dark:text-green-100 mb-2">847</div>
					<div class="text-sm text-green-600 dark:text-green-400">89% од планираните</div>
				</div>

				<div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-50 to-violet-50 dark:from-purple-900/20 dark:to-violet-900/10 rounded-2xl p-6">
					<div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
						<div class="w-12 h-12 bg-purple-100 dark:bg-purple-900/30 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center">
							<span class="text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400 text-xl">👨‍🏫</span>
						</div>
						<div>
							<h4 class="font-bold text-purple-900 dark:text-purple-100">Активни Наставници</h4>
							<p class="text-sm text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400">Креираат содржина</p>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="text-3xl font-black text-purple-900 dark:text-purple-100 mb-2">18</div>
					<div class="text-sm text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400">78% од вкупно</div>
				</div>

				<div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-orange-50 to-amber-50 dark:from-orange-900/20 dark:to-amber-900/10 rounded-2xl p-6">
					<div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
						<div class="w-12 h-12 bg-orange-100 dark:bg-orange-900/30 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center">
							<span class="text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400 text-xl">🎬</span>
						</div>
						<div>
							<h4 class="font-bold text-orange-900 dark:text-orange-100">Креирани Анимации</h4>
							<p class="text-sm text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400">Овој месец</p>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="text-3xl font-black text-orange-900 dark:text-orange-100 mb-2">127</div>
					<div class="text-sm text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400">+23% од минатиот</div>
				</div>
			</div>

			{/* Grade Performance */}
			<div class="mb-8">
				<h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-6">Успех по Одделенија</h4>
				<div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 lg:grid-cols-6 gap-4">
					{[
						{ grade: 5, score: 4.1, change: '+0.2' },
						{ grade: 6, score: 4.0, change: '+0.1' },
						{ grade: 7, score: 3.9, change: '+0.3' },
						{ grade: 8, score: 4.2, change: '+0.4' },
						{ grade: 9, score: 4.3, change: '+0.2' },
						{ grade: 10, score: 4.1, change: '+0.1' }
					].map(item => (
						<div class="bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-xl p-4 text-center">
							<div class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-1">{item.grade}.</div>
							<div class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-1">{item.score}</div>
							<div class="text-xs text-green-600 font-medium">{item.change}</div>
						</div>
					))}
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>

	{/* Implementation Steps */}
	<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto mb-16">
		<div class="text-center mb-12">
			<h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-4">Како да Имплементираме</h2>
			<p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto">Едноставен процес за воведување на МатАрхива во вашето училиште.</p>
		</div>

		<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
			<div class="text-center">
				<div class="w-16 h-16 bg-orange-100 dark:bg-orange-900/30 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6">
					<span class="text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400 text-2xl font-bold">1</span>
				</div>
				<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-3">Регистрација</h3>
				<p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Креирајте училишна сметка со основни информации.</p>
			</div>

			<div class="text-center">
				<div class="w-16 h-16 bg-amber-100 dark:bg-amber-900/30 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6">
					<span class="text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 text-2xl font-bold">2</span>
				</div>
				<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-3">Конфигурација</h3>
				<p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Додадете наставници и ученици, конфигурирајте класи.</p>
			</div>

			<div class="text-center">
				<div class="w-16 h-16 bg-yellow-100 dark:bg-yellow-900/30 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6">
					<span class="text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 text-2xl font-bold">3</span>
				</div>
				<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-3">Тренинг</h3>
				<p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Обука на наставниците и воведување на платформата.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>

	{/* Pricing/Contact CTA */}
	<div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-orange-600 to-amber-600 rounded-[3rem] p-12 md:p-16 text-white" id="contact">
		<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
			<h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black mb-6">Трансформирајте Математичката Настава</h2>
			<p class="text-orange-100 text-xl mb-10 leading-relaxed">
				Придружете се на водечките училишта кои користат МатАрхива за подобрување на математичките резултати.
			</p>

			<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-10">
				<div class="bg-white/10 rounded-2xl p-6 backdrop-blur-sm">
					<h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Basic</h3>
					<div class="text-3xl font-black mb-4">Бесплатно</div>
					<ul class="text-left space-y-2 text-sm">
						<li>✓ До 100 ученици</li>
						<li>✓ Основни алатки</li>
						<li>✓ Email поддршка</li>
					</ul>
				</div>

				<div class="bg-white/10 rounded-2xl p-6 backdrop-blur-sm border-2 border-white/30">
					<div class="flex items-center justify-center mb-2">
						<span class="bg-white text-orange-600 px-2 py-1 rounded text-xs font-bold">НАЈПОПУЛАРНО</span>
					</div>
					<h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Professional</h3>
					<div class="text-3xl font-black mb-4">50€/месец</div>
					<ul class="text-left space-y-2 text-sm">
						<li>✓ Неограничени ученици</li>
						<li>✓ Сите алатки</li>
						<li>✓ Priority поддршка</li>
						<li>✓ Детална аналитика</li>
					</ul>
				</div>

				<div class="bg-white/10 rounded-2xl p-6 backdrop-blur-sm">
					<h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Enterprise</h3>
					<div class="text-3xl font-black mb-4">Контакт</div>
					<ul class="text-left space-y-2 text-sm">
						<li>✓ Custom интеграции</li>
						<li>✓ On-premise опција</li>
						<li>✓ 24/7 поддршка</li>
						<li>✓ API пристап</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
				<a href="/schools/signup" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white text-orange-600 font-bold py-4 px-8 rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-50 transition-all">
					<span>Започни Бесплатно</span>
					<svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
						<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 7l5 5m0 0l-5 5m5-5H6"/>
					</svg>
				</a>
				<a href="mailto:schools@matarhiva.mk" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-orange-500/20 hover:bg-orange-500/30 text-white font-bold py-4 px-8 rounded-xl border border-white/20 transition-all">
					<span>Контактирај Нас</span>
				</a>
			</div>

			<p class="text-orange-200 text-sm mt-6">30-дневна гаранција за враќање на пари • Нема скриени трошоци</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</Layout>